WEBVTT

00:00:10.045 --> 00:00:11.085
(GASPS)

00:00:21.605 --> 00:00:24.045
So, you don't know
where he is.

00:00:26.445 --> 00:00:29.365
Would you like
to find out?

00:00:37.245 --> 00:00:38.725
(RELIEVED SIGH)

00:01:08.645 --> 00:01:10.005
(BEEPING)

00:01:46.445 --> 00:01:50.765
(SOBBING) I am such an idiot.
I let this happen, you know.

00:01:51.685 --> 00:01:55.445
The new sports car,
the getting in shape,
the blond hair, the lies.

00:01:55.525 --> 00:01:58.445
Yes, he attempts
to relive the past.

00:01:58.525 --> 00:02:00.325
Now I'm losing him!

00:02:00.405 --> 00:02:02.885
What'll I do?
What'll I do?

00:02:03.005 --> 00:02:05.405
What are you
talking about?

00:02:07.005 --> 00:02:08.645
You are Elastigirl!

00:02:08.725 --> 00:02:11.125
My God!
Pull yourself together.

00:02:11.205 --> 00:02:13.285
What will you do?
Is this a question?

00:02:13.405 --> 00:02:15.885
Show him you remember
that he is Mr. Incredible,

00:02:15.965 --> 00:02:18.885
and you will remind him
who you are!

00:02:19.005 --> 00:02:20.725
Well, you know
where he is. Go!

00:02:20.805 --> 00:02:23.285
Confront the problem!
Fight! Win!

00:02:23.965 --> 00:02:27.325
And call me when
you get back, darling.
I enjoy our visits.

00:02:27.565 --> 00:02:29.965
There's lots of leftovers
that you can reheat.

00:02:30.085 --> 00:02:31.645
Make sure Dash
does his homework.

00:02:31.725 --> 00:02:34.365
And both of you,
get to bed on time.

00:02:34.445 --> 00:02:36.325
I should be back
tonight. Late.

00:02:36.405 --> 00:02:37.845
You can be in charge
that long, can't you?

00:02:37.925 --> 00:02:41.085
Yeah. But why am I
in charge again?

00:02:41.165 --> 00:02:43.525
Nothing. Just a little
trouble with Daddy.

00:02:43.645 --> 00:02:47.925
You mean Dad's in trouble,
or Dad is the trouble?

00:02:48.045 --> 00:02:51.885
I mean either
he's in trouble,
or he's going to be.

00:02:58.605 --> 00:03:01.005
What's that?
Where'd you
get that, Mom?

00:03:01.085 --> 00:03:03.245
You made a cool outfit?
Hey, are those for us?

00:03:03.325 --> 00:03:04.765
We all get
cool outfits?

00:03:06.125 --> 00:03:07.845
Dash! You come back
here this moment!

00:03:07.925 --> 00:03:08.925
(PHONE RINGS)

00:03:10.285 --> 00:03:12.765
Hey, Snug.
Thanks for getting back.

00:03:12.845 --> 00:03:14.205
I know this is
short notice,

00:03:14.285 --> 00:03:15.645
but I was hoping
that I could...

00:03:15.725 --> 00:03:17.245
What are these?

00:03:17.325 --> 00:03:18.685
Look, I'm The Dash!

00:03:19.285 --> 00:03:20.605
The Dash likes.

00:03:20.685 --> 00:03:21.965
HELEN: Just a second.

00:03:22.125 --> 00:03:23.965
Take that off
before somebody sees.

00:03:24.045 --> 00:03:25.805
You're packing
one just like it.

00:03:25.885 --> 00:03:27.245
Are you hiding something?

00:03:27.325 --> 00:03:28.685
Please. I'm on the phone...

00:03:28.765 --> 00:03:30.885
Dash!
This is yours.
It's specially made.

00:03:30.965 --> 00:03:32.285
What's going on?

00:03:32.365 --> 00:03:34.365
You're not coming!
I gotta pack!

00:03:36.885 --> 00:03:38.885
What makes you think
it's special?

00:03:38.965 --> 00:03:41.765
I don't know.
Why'd Mom try
to hide it?

00:03:50.605 --> 00:03:53.685
Snug, I'm calling in
a solid you owe me.

00:03:53.765 --> 00:03:54.925
(OVER PHONE)
What do you need?

00:03:55.005 --> 00:03:57.405
A jet. What do you
got that's fast?

00:03:57.485 --> 00:03:59.685
Let me think.

00:04:08.365 --> 00:04:11.365
Island approach.
India Golf niner-niner
checking in.

00:04:11.445 --> 00:04:13.085
VFR on top. Over.

00:04:13.165 --> 00:04:14.645
(RADIO STATIC)

00:04:16.125 --> 00:04:18.845
Island tower, this is
India Golf niner-niner

00:04:18.965 --> 00:04:21.245
requesting vectors
to the initial.

00:04:21.365 --> 00:04:22.845
(RADIO STATIC)

00:04:32.045 --> 00:04:34.205
Easy, Helen.
Easy. Easy, girl.

00:04:34.325 --> 00:04:36.285
You're overreacting.
Everything's fine.

00:04:36.365 --> 00:04:38.525
They're just all
getting coffee.

00:04:40.165 --> 00:04:43.685
At the same time. Yeah.

00:04:57.325 --> 00:05:00.965
You, sir, truly are
"Mr. Incredible."

00:05:01.045 --> 00:05:02.485
I was right
to idolize you.

00:05:02.565 --> 00:05:05.405
I always knew
you were tough,
but tricking the probe

00:05:05.485 --> 00:05:09.445
by hiding under the bones
of another super? Oh, man!

00:05:09.525 --> 00:05:11.885
I'm still geeking out
about it!

00:05:12.005 --> 00:05:13.205
(SIGHS)

00:05:13.565 --> 00:05:16.765
And then you had
to just go
and ruin the ride.

00:05:16.845 --> 00:05:19.485
I mean, Mr. Incredible
calling for help?

00:05:19.565 --> 00:05:21.765
(MOCKING)
"Help me, help me."

00:05:21.885 --> 00:05:24.325
Lame, lame, lame.

00:05:24.405 --> 00:05:25.845
All right,
who did you contact?

00:05:25.925 --> 00:05:28.765
Contact?
What are you
talking about?

00:05:31.205 --> 00:05:32.685
(GROANING)

00:05:33.765 --> 00:05:36.845
I am referring
to last night
at 23:07 hours

00:05:36.925 --> 00:05:38.365
while you were
snooping around.

00:05:38.445 --> 00:05:40.085
You sent out
a homing signal.

00:05:40.205 --> 00:05:43.165
I didn't know about
the homing device.

00:05:47.685 --> 00:05:51.685
And now a government plane
is requesting permission
to land here.

00:05:51.765 --> 00:05:52.765
Who did you contact?

00:05:52.845 --> 00:05:54.925
I didn't send
for a plane.

00:05:55.005 --> 00:05:56.925
Play the transmission.

00:05:58.205 --> 00:06:00.445
HELEN:
India Golf checking in.

00:06:00.525 --> 00:06:01.565
Helen!

00:06:02.285 --> 00:06:04.685
So you do know
these people.

00:06:04.765 --> 00:06:07.965
Well, then,
I'll send them
a little greeting.

00:06:10.805 --> 00:06:12.445
VIOLET: Ow!
Violet!

00:06:12.525 --> 00:06:13.965
It's not my fault.

00:06:14.085 --> 00:06:16.125
Dash ran away,
I knew I'd get
blamed for it.

00:06:16.205 --> 00:06:18.045
That's not true!

00:06:18.125 --> 00:06:20.525
You said,
"Something's up with Mom.
We have to find out what."

00:06:20.605 --> 00:06:22.285
...and it's
not my fault!

00:06:22.365 --> 00:06:24.445
Hundred percent
all-yours idea!

00:06:24.525 --> 00:06:27.405
Wait a minute.
You left Jack-Jack alone?

00:06:27.485 --> 00:06:30.565
Of course we got a sitter.
We got someone, Mom.

00:06:30.645 --> 00:06:31.845
We wouldn't do that.

00:06:31.925 --> 00:06:32.885
Thanks a lot!

00:06:32.965 --> 00:06:35.805
All right, well,
who'd you get?

00:06:36.125 --> 00:06:38.325
You don't have to worry
about one thing.

00:06:38.405 --> 00:06:39.885
I've got
baby-sitting wired.

00:06:39.965 --> 00:06:41.685
I've taken courses,
learned CPR,

00:06:41.765 --> 00:06:44.245
excellent marks
and certificates.

00:06:44.325 --> 00:06:45.325
Kari.

00:06:45.445 --> 00:06:47.605
I brought Mozart to
play while he sleeps

00:06:47.685 --> 00:06:50.605
because leading experts say
Mozart makes babies smarter.

00:06:50.885 --> 00:06:51.885
Kari...
The beauty is

00:06:51.965 --> 00:06:54.605
they don't have to listen
'cause they're asleep!

00:06:54.725 --> 00:06:56.845
I wish my parents
played Mozart

00:06:56.925 --> 00:06:59.925
because half the time
I don't know what
anyone's talking about.

00:07:00.165 --> 00:07:03.605
Kari, I really don't feel
comfortable with this.

00:07:03.685 --> 00:07:06.645
I'll pay you for your trouble,
but I'd rather call a service.

00:07:07.005 --> 00:07:08.685
There's really
no need, Mrs. Parr.

00:07:08.765 --> 00:07:11.445
I can totally handle
anything this baby
can dish out.

00:07:11.525 --> 00:07:14.285
(COOING) Can't I,
little baby?
I can handle it.

00:07:14.365 --> 00:07:16.325
Who can handle it?
(BEEPING)

00:07:24.005 --> 00:07:26.525
India Golf niner-niner
transmitting in the
blind guard.

00:07:26.605 --> 00:07:29.165
Disengage.
Repeat, disengage.

